<div data-cgap-sector="Building Systems &amp; Facilities" data-cgap-term="facility"></div><p class="lead">Facility managers cover a little of everything: a boiler room, a roof full of equipment, an elevator machine room, a pool chemical room and the grounds. Each space has its own hazard, and each one needs a sign that tells a tenant, contractor or new hire exactly what to do there.</p><p>These signs are written for the parts of a building that maintenance teams actually own, including mechanical and boiler rooms, roof hatches and rooftop units, cooling towers, electrical rooms and generators, elevator machine rooms, pool chemical storage, tanning and UV rooms, radon and the grounds. They are 8x12 aluminum and mount on doors, walls, fences and equipment.</p><h2>What to post, and where</h2><div class="il-areas"><div class="il-area il-best"><h3>Most ordered</h3><p>The signs customers in this industry order most.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-indoor-tanning-bed-uv-radiation-sign-8x12-aluminum-skin-cancer-risk-eye-protection-required-tanning-salon-warning-sign-by-cgap-safety">Indoor Tanning Bed UV Radiation</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-no-trespassing-sign-hazardous-conditions-present-keep-out-8x12-rust-resistant-aluminum-uv-resistant-pre-drilled-outdoor-safety-sign-by-cgap-safety">No Trespassing</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-automatic-lawn-mower-operating-sign-machine-may-move-without-warning-keep-children-and-pets-clear-8x12-rust-resistant-aluminum-uv-resistant-outdoor-yard-safety-sign-pre-drilled-by-cgap-safety">Automatic Lawn Mower</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/cgap-safety-danger-exposure-to-radon-gas-sign-basement-air-quality-tested-radon-levels-often-elevated-8x12-aluminum-safety-sign-high-visibility-indoor-outdoor">Exposure to Radon Gas</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Mechanical and boiler rooms</h3><p>Boilers, steam lines and mechanical room doors. 179 signs. Typical spot: Mount on the tank support or nearest wall at head height.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-steam-condensate-line-sign-burn-scald-hazard-stay-clear-8x12-rust-resistant-aluminum-boiler-room-pipe-safety-sign-by-cgap-safety">Steam Condensate Line</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-steam-generator-sign-cgap-w19227-812">Steam Generator</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-expansion-tank-sign-cgap-c03492-812">Expansion Tank</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-boiler-manway-sign-cgap-n07667-812">Boiler Manway</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Roofs, hatches and rooftop units</h3><p>Roof access, hatches and rooftop equipment. 182 signs. Typical spot: On the skylight curb or at roof access points.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-rooftop-skylight-sign-8x12-aluminum">Rooftop Skylight</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-roof-hatch-sign-cgap-w19278-812">Roof Hatch</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-roof-gas-line-sign-cgap-c16068-812">Roof Gas Line</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-roof-drain-sign-cgap-n18239-812">Roof Drain</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Cooling towers and chillers</h3><p>Tower basins, fan decks and chiller rooms. 155 signs. Typical spot: At the fan deck access ladder or stair landing.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-cooling-tower-fan-sign-8x12-aluminum">Cooling Tower Fan</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-cooling-tower-fill-pack-sign-cgap-w05432-812">Cooling Tower Fill Pack</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-chiller-room-low-pipe-sign-cgap-c22061-812">Chiller Room Low Pipe</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-cooling-tower-fan-vfd-sign-cgap-n06388-812">Cooling Tower Fan VFD</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Electrical rooms and generators</h3><p>Electrical rooms, panels and standby power. 11 signs. Typical spot: Mounted at eye level at the transfer switch, where staff will see it before working.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-electrical-room-sign-high-voltage-8x12-rust-resistant-aluminum-safety-sign-for-utility-maintenance-industrial-facilities-mechanical-electrical-rooms-by-cgap-safety">Electrical Room</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-electrical-shock-hazard-do-not-touch-sign-8x12-aluminum">Electrical Shock Hazard</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-transfer-switch-sign-cgap-n15208-812">Transfer Switch</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-switchgear-room-sign-cgap-i20661-812">Switchgear Room</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Elevator machine rooms</h3><p>Machine rooms, pits and hoistway access. 23 signs. Typical spot: Inside the hoistway at the pit ladder, visible from the lowest landing.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-elevator-pit-sign-8x12-aluminum">Elevator Pit</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-service-elevator-cab-floor-sign-cgap-c15466-812">Service Elevator Cab Floor</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-elevator-pit-sump-sign-cgap-n20393-812">Elevator Pit Sump</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-freight-elevator-sign-cgap-i16464-812">Freight Elevator</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Pool chemical rooms</h3><p>Chlorine, acid and pump rooms for pools and spas. 110 signs. Typical spot: On the filter tank beside the air bleed valve and cover clamp, at eye level.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-pool-chemical-storage-sign-no-food-or-drinks-in-area-separate-acid-from-chlorine-8x12-rust-resistant-aluminum-pool-room-safety-sign-by-cgap-safety">Pool Chemical Storage</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-pool-filter-air-bleed-sign-cgap-w07828-812">Pool Filter Air Bleed</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-pool-shock-pallet-sign-cgap-c11574-812">Pool Shock Pallet</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-pool-heater-sign-cgap-n08409-812">Pool Heater</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Tanning, UV and radon</h3><p>Tanning beds, UV disinfection and radon testing. 5 signs. Typical spot: On the UV reactor housing, at eye level near the uv treatment unit.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-indoor-tanning-bed-uv-radiation-sign-8x12-aluminum-skin-cancer-risk-eye-protection-required-tanning-salon-warning-sign-by-cgap-safety">Indoor Tanning Bed UV Radiation</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/cgap-safety-danger-exposure-to-radon-gas-sign-basement-air-quality-tested-radon-levels-often-elevated-8x12-aluminum-safety-sign-high-visibility-indoor-outdoor">Exposure to Radon Gas</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-uv-treatment-unit-sign-cgap-c06794-812">UV Treatment Unit</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-pool-uv-reactor-sign-cgap-n14334-812">Pool UV Reactor</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Grounds and property</h3><p>Mowers, trespassing, evacuation routes and the grounds. 9 signs. Typical spot: Mounted at eye level at the mower fueling station, where staff will see it before working.</p><ul><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-no-trespassing-sign-hazardous-conditions-present-keep-out-8x12-rust-resistant-aluminum-uv-resistant-pre-drilled-outdoor-safety-sign-by-cgap-safety">No Trespassing</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/danger-automatic-lawn-mower-operating-sign-machine-may-move-without-warning-keep-children-and-pets-clear-8x12-rust-resistant-aluminum-uv-resistant-outdoor-yard-safety-sign-pre-drilled-by-cgap-safety">Automatic Lawn Mower</a></li><li><span data-s="DANGER">DANGER</span><a href="/products/evacuation-route-sign-right-arrow-8x12-aluminum">Evacuation Route</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-mower-fueling-station-sign-cgap-n24295-812">Mower Fueling Station</a></li></ul></div></div><h2>Common questions</h2><div class="il-faq"><details><summary>What signs does a mechanical room need?</summary><p>Typical postings cover authorized personnel only, hot pipes and steam, noise and hearing protection, and where the shutoffs are. Search &quot;mechanical room&quot; or &quot;boiler room&quot; to see them by install point.</p></details><details><summary>Do you have tanning bed and UV signs for salons and gyms?</summary><p>Yes. The Indoor Tanning Bed UV Radiation sign is one of our most ordered signs. Search &quot;tanning&quot; to see it.</p></details><details><summary>Can you make a sign for a space that is not listed?</summary><p>Probably already. Describe the room or equipment in the search box. If nothing fits, request a quote and we will make it.</p></details></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "What signs does a mechanical room need?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Typical postings cover authorized personnel only, hot pipes and steam, noise and hearing protection, and where the shutoffs are. Search \"mechanical room\" or \"boiler room\" to see them by install point."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name":